/* every block and cell carries its state's glyph (docs/CONTRACT.md \xA735: colour is never alone): on the tone's fill in the
   surface's colour, on a muted or neutral fill in the text's. A block narrower than a glyph keeps it hidden (its word is
   in its hover), never squeezed */
